{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21698","headline":"酬乐天得微之诗知通州事因成四首 四 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天得微之诗知通州事因成四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒芜满院不能锄，甑有尘埃圃乏蔬。\n定觉身将囚一种，未知生共死何如。\n饥摇困尾丧家狗，热暴枯鳞失水鱼。\n苦境万般君莫问，自怜方寸本来虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}